        "text": "/sprint",
        "styles": {
          "code": true
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": " was invoked while the editor is not in Focus Mode, entering a time interval and pressing Enter will automatically enter Focus Mode with a timer set to that interval. The timer will begin on the first keystroke.",
